Auto dioti otan exo macvlan kai bridge o host den mporei directly na milisei me ta container. Edo exo thema dioti o webserver einai tftp/dhcp  kai xrisimopiei to idio diktio tou host.
i need --network host of dhcp so host pc can not ping ips in macvlan

# 1. Create a macvlan shim interface bound to ens18
sudo ip link add pub_net-shim link ens18 type macvlan mode bridge

# 2. Assign it an IP from the pub_net subnet
sudo ip addr add 10.0.48.250/24 dev pub_net-shim

# 3. Bring it up
sudo ip link set pub_net-shim up


Ousiastika thelo 2 diktia.
to ena einai tou host kai to kanei use of webserver container. Ston proxmonx einai bridge sto ens18 to exoteriko net
to alo einai to 192.168.199.0/24 opou dino kai dhcp range kai einai brindge se mia ali karta diktiou tou proxmox. Opios pesei pano akou ton dhcp sercer..


episis o server pou tha hostari ta containers prepei na exei:
root@container-server-prox2:~# sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.ip_forward=1
net.ipv4.ip_forward = 1
root@container-server-prox2:~# iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING -o ens18 -j MASQUERADE
root@container-server-prox2:~# 

docker network create -d macvlan \
  --subnet=10.0.48.0/24 \
  --gateway=10.0.48.1 \
  -o parent=ens18 \
  pub_net



to dhcp akouei sto ens19 kai prepei na exei ip ston host:
 ip addr add 192.168.199.1/24 dev ens19














