Prepei na exo ftiaxei apo prin to database users. kai na exo volumes gia na einai persistent. exo endpoint /create-table gia na ftiaxi osous pinakes thelo
create image: cd /home/geo/database
sudo docker build -t database -f databasefile .
sudo /usr/bin/docker run  -d --name database --volume datavbase_volume:/var/lib/postgresql/data --network pub_net --ip 10.0.48.100 database 



webserver:
cd /home/geo/webserver
sudo docker build -t webserver:latest -f  dnsmasqfile-web .
docker run  -d -it --name webserver --network host   --cap-add=NET_ADMIN  -v /home/geo/dnsmasq.conf:/etc/dnsmasq.conf -v /localrepo/:/var/www/html/ubuntu -v /srv/tftp:/srv/tftp webserver


